# 15. The hardest network failure

Consider:

```text
Backend
  │
BEGIN
  │
Debit Alice
Credit Bob
Ledger
  │
COMMIT ✓
  │
API crashes
  X
```

The browser never receives the response.

Without idempotency:

```text
retry
→ second debit
```

With idempotency:

```text
retry same key
       │
       ▼
find committed transfer
       │
       ▼
return original receipt
```

This should be one of your judge explanations.

