# 19. Money Request

Flow:

```text
Alice requests ৳1,200 from Bob

             │
             ▼
          PENDING
             │
       ┌─────┴─────┐
       ▼           ▼
    Decline       Pay
       │           │
       ▼           ▼
   DECLINED    TransferEngine
                   │
                   ▼
                 PAID
```

A critical rule:

> **MoneyRequestService never directly modifies account balances.**

It delegates to the one authoritative transfer service.

Your earlier BalanceLoop reference similarly emphasized explicit settlement semantics and full balance history, ideas that translate well to this request workflow. 

