# 20. Money Request concurrency

Suppose Bob double-clicks Pay.

```text
API-1                      API-3

Pay request #123          Pay request #123
       │                         │
       ▼                         ▼
LOCK request #123           waits
       │
status=PENDING
       │
execute transfer
       │
mark PAID
       │
COMMIT
                                 │
                                 ▼
                          reads status=PAID
                                 │
                                 ▼
                          return existing state
```

One payment.

Not two.

