# 21. Transaction states

Avoid overcomplicating synchronous transfers.

For P0:

```text
COMPLETED
REVERSED
```

Rejected transfer attempts are primarily audit events rather than permanent financial transactions.

Later asynchronous systems may introduce:

```text
CREATED
PENDING
PROCESSING
COMPLETED
FAILED
```

but that is unnecessary complexity for this synchronous internal-wallet transfer.

