# 33. Gateway

Use HAProxy or Nginx.

Requirements:

* round-robin backend routing;
* `/health/ready` checks;
* stop sending traffic to unhealthy backend;
* propagate request/trace ID;
* don't blindly replay money-changing POST requests.

The client should deliberately retry with the **same idempotency key**.

