# 34. Redis decision

## P0

Do not require Redis.

## P1

Use Redis only for:

```text
distributed rate limit counters
optional short-lived safe caches
```

Never store authoritative:

```text
balance
ledger
transfer completion
```

If Redis dies:

```text
financial correctness must remain intact
```

That gives you graceful degradation.

