# 36. Financial invariants

These should be written down in your README and tests.

### Invariant 1

```text
account.balance_minor >= 0
```

### Invariant 2

```text
transfer.amount_minor > 0
```

### Invariant 3

```text
sender != receiver
```

### Invariant 4

For every completed transfer:

```text
debit amount
=
credit amount
```

### Invariant 5

```text
SUM(ledger signed amounts for transfer)
=
0
```

### Invariant 6

A completed transfer has exactly:

```text
1 debit entry
1 credit entry
```

for ordinary P2P transfer.

### Invariant 7

One logical idempotency key can create at most one financial resource.

### Invariant 8

One money request can be paid at most once.

### Invariant 9

```text
sum(user balances)
=
net amount issued by system
```

for the closed ecosystem.

### Invariant 10

There is no completed transfer without an auditable reference.

