# 40. Failure semantics

| Failure                                 | Required result               |
| --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Invalid input                           | 400, no transaction           |
| Unauthorized user                       | 401/403                       |
| Insufficient balance                    | reject, no money changed      |
| Duplicate request                       | return original transaction   |
| Same idempotency key, different request | 409                           |
| API dies before DB transaction          | retry safely                  |
| API dies before commit                  | DB rollback                   |
| API dies after commit                   | retry returns existing result |
| Receiver update fails                   | full rollback                 |
| Ledger insert fails                     | full rollback                 |
| PostgreSQL unavailable                  | fail closed                   |
| Redis unavailable                       | money engine still correct    |
| One API replica dies                    | gateway routes to others      |
| Deadlock                                | DB abort + bounded retry      |
| Browser goes offline                    | don't claim success           |

